--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files in this package derived from the upstream sources, and modified
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/versions/har.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/versions/har.ts. Upstream declares the
    HAR 1.2 shapes as TypeScript types, which are erased at runtime; this
    port needs a reader, so each type became a class with `fromJson` and
    `toJson`.

lib/src/versions/trace_v10.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/versions/traceV10.ts, as the typed
    reader of the current format. `ActionPhase` is a Dart enum where upstream
    has a string union, and `EventTraceEvent` and `ConsoleMessageTraceEvent`
    share a `TimelineTraceEvent` base because Dart has no union type and the
    model keeps the two in one list ordered by time.

lib/src/versions/trace_v3.dart .. trace_v9.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/versions/traceV3.ts .. traceV9.ts. The
    modernizer reads an old trace as raw JSON, exactly as upstream does, so
    these carry each version's shape as writers: they are what a test uses to
    build a fixture of a real old trace. A type that did not change from the
    previous version is re-exported instead of copied; upstream repeats it,
    because each of its files is a frozen self-contained copy.

lib/src/trace.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/trace.ts.

lib/src/entries.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/entries.ts. `ActionEntry` extends the
    action event instead of intersecting with it, and carries the two
    neighbour links that upstream hangs off the object with a `Symbol`.

lib/src/trace_utils.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/traceUtils.ts.

lib/src/trace_modernizer.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/traceModernizer.ts, step by step. The
    chain is dispatched through a table instead of by building a method name
    at runtime. One behaviour differs: where upstream indexes `events[0]` in
    `_modernize_6_to_7` and would throw on an empty list, this port takes the
    same branch it would take one line later and synthesizes the context
    event.

lib/src/trace_model.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/traceModel.ts. `ResourceEntry` holds
    the HAR entry beside its id instead of spreading a copy of it, so the
    entry the snapshot renderer serves stays the same object. Rendering an
    action title needs a locator generator, which is a separate front of this
    port; it arrives as `LocatorDescriber` and defaults to showing the
    selector as recorded.

lib/src/trace_loader.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/traceLoader.ts. `Blob` became
    `Uint8List`, and the content type the loader attaches to a resource
    became `TraceResource` instead of a typed `Blob`.

lib/src/snapshot_storage.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/snapshotStorage.ts.

lib/src/snapshot_renderer.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/snapshotRenderer.ts.
    `rewriteURLForCustomProtocol` is built on `Uri` instead of the WHATWG
    `URL`; a URL with an opaque path comes back unchanged, which is what
    assigning `protocol` and `hostname` on such a URL does in a browser.

lib/src/snapshot_script.dart
    The `applyPlaywrightAttributes` function of snapshotRenderer.ts. Upstream
    ships it by calling `.toString()` on the compiled function; Dart cannot,
    so the source is kept as text, with the TypeScript annotations stripped
    and nothing else changed.

lib/src/snapshot_server.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/trace/snapshotServer.ts. Upstream answers
    with `Response` objects of the fetch API, because it runs in a service
    worker; here an answer is plain data (`SnapshotResponse`), so the same
    code serves an `HttpServer` of `dart:io` and a service worker compiled by
    dart2js.

lib/src/lru_cache.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/lruCache.ts.

lib/src/string_utils.dart
    The two HTML escapers of packages/isomorphic/stringUtils.ts.

lib/src/protocol_metainfo.dart
    Transcription of packages/isomorphic/protocolMetainfo.ts, which upstream
    generates from protocol.yml. Regenerate it when the upstream reference is
    rolled.

lib/src/protocol_formatter.dart
    Port of packages/isomorphic/protocolFormatter.ts, minus the call into
    `locatorGenerators.ts`, which is not ported yet; see `LocatorDescriber`.

lib/src/zip_trace_backend.dart and lib/io.dart
    Written for this port. Upstream unzips the archive inside its service
    worker with code of its own; here the zip codec is `package:archive` and
    the platform side is isolated behind `TraceLoaderBackend`, so the model
    compiles to the web.
